{"id":"0411b4197c","t":"The Scorched Desert’s Sand Mage","c":"cv","n":33,"l":33,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage"},"u":1795219165202,"desc":"بعد تحويل الأرض إلى بيئة صالحة للسكن، اختفت البحار وتحول العالم إلى رمال لا نهاية لها. في هذه الأرض المدمرة، يقف زيون كساحر الرمال الوحيد المتبقي. يخشاه الآخرون باسم شبح الرمال، ويستخدم الصحراء بأكملها كسلاح في عالم وحشي…","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":[],"src":{"ml":"the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage|/manga/the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage/1/"},"2":{"ml":"the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage|/manga/the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage/2/"},"3":{"ml":"the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage|/manga/the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage/3/"},"4":{"ml":"the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage|/manga/the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage/4/"},"5":{"ml":"the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage|/manga/the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage/5/"},"6":{"ml":"the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage|/manga/the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage/6/"},"7":{"ml":"the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage|/manga/the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage/7/"},"8":{"ml":"the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage|/manga/the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage/8/"},"9":{"ml":"the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage|/manga/the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage/9/"},"10":{"ml":"the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage|/manga/the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage/10/"},"11":{"ml":"the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage|/manga/the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage/11/"},"12":{"ml":"the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage|/manga/the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage/12/"},"13":{"ml":"the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage|/manga/the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage/13/"},"14":{"ml":"the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage|/manga/the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage/14/"},"15":{"ml":"the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage|/manga/the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage/15/"},"16":{"ml":"the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage|/manga/the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage/16/"},"17":{"ml":"the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage|/manga/the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage/17/"},"18":{"ml":"the-scorched-deserts-sand-mage|/manga/the-sc